    "created_at": "2015-02-20T08:48:00Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-02-20T08:48:00Z",
    "body": "The native `fetch()` API implemented by browsers does not use XMLHttpRequest underneath. The eventual API for progress is building something on https://streams.spec.whatwg.org/ which https://github.com/yutakahirano/fetch-with-streams/ is adding to `fetch()`.\n",
